<p>post /chat -&gt; Try it out  -&gt; Request body {&ldquo;message&rdquo;: &ldquo;我想减肥&rdquo;} -&gt; Execute -&gt; 下方 Response body 复制返回的 session_id
-&gt; Request body {&ldquo;session_id&rdquo;: &ldquo;刚才复制的那串&rdquo;,&ldquo;message&rdquo;: &ldquo;172，68公斤，28岁，男的&rdquo;} -&gt; Execute -&gt; Request body
